WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.267
Devastating word

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.635
from a Mexican border town.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.771
Local officials announcing this morning

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.706
two American kidnap victims

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.441
kidnaping victims are dead.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.710
Two others, authorities say, are alive.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.479
And a source tells CNN right now

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:13.947
that one of those two

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:14.948
locked in a battle

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.016
to survive

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:16.383
the race

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:17.050
against the clock

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:17.484
to find

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.151
the hostages

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.519
started last week

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.588
in Matamoros, just across the border

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.023
with a brazen attack.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.124
You can see it here.

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.292
Gunmen firing on that white minivan

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.595
before pulling Americans from the car

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.296
and speeding away.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.531
CNN's John Miller is working

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.832
his sources from New York.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:33.800
And as Carrie outward

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.601
monitoring this from

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.635
the State Department,

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.202
we begin

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.570
with our security correspondent

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.805
Josh Campbell in Los Angeles.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:39.372
Josh,

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.307
what's the latest on the wow,

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.509
the sad tragedy here?

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.611
Yeah, sad indeed, John.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.112
And you know, since this incident began,

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.680
I've been talking to sources

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.782
trying to get information

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:50.450
about where these victims were,

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:50.984
what the U.S.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.153
government was doing to try to find them.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.254
And to a person,

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.855
these sources told me that, look,

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.824
the prospect here is very grim,

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.726
and that is because of that video

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.561
that you just showed, that graphic video

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.362
where you see

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.930
individuals being loaded

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.597
and shoved

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.633
into the back of that white vehicle.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.100
One U.S.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.901
official told me

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:08.501
that that appeared

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:09.602
to be the aftermath

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.704
of this original incident.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:12.872
And because of that

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.140
violent nature of the attack,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:14.941
as well as you see

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.376
people being loaded into the car

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.244
that didn't appear to be moving again,

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.746
the sources feared the worst,

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.947
even as they worked

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.382
to try to release these captives.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:23.083
We are learning,

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.150
as you mentioned, though,

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.318
the breaking news here,

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.387
that two of those American citizens

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.189
were found deceased.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.424
Of the other two, those who survived.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.526
I'm told that one is in

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.462
grave condition, was severely wounded

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.230
during this encounter.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.032
Now, as far as where they were found,

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.333
a source tells me that it was at

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.868
some type of clinic

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:42.902
in Matamoros,

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.504
which, of course, is the area

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.539
where these American citizens traveled

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:46.973
when they went

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.775
from South Carolina to Texas

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.743
and then into Mexico

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.779
seeking some type of medical procedure.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:52.946
They,

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.415
of course, were quickly met by gunfire

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.183
as they traveled into Mexico.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.551
One source told me that

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.752
law enforcement believes

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:00.553
at this point

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:04.023
that a cartel known as the Gulf Cartel

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.392
mistook these American citizens

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:08.061
for Haitian drugs.

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.429
Smugglers opened fire.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.463
I'm told that law enforcement

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.131
doesn't believe

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.233
this began as a kidnaping operation.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.101
It was some type of kill operation

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.103
between two types of rival factions.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.539
However, these American citizens mistaken

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.174
for drug smugglers,

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:23.209
they were engaged by these attackers

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.277
and then taken away.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:24.777
And, of course,

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:25.745
where this goes from now,

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:26.546
I'm told,

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.447
John, by a source

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:28.681
just before we got on the air

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.850
that Mexican officials will be conducting

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.285
the forensic examination

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.386
of the two bodies,

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.021
those two who are deceased.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.689
After that, medical examiner

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:37.390
does a review

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.791
to determine the cause of death.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.993
Those remains will be handed

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:40.860
over to the U.S.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.862
government and then retreat, titrated

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:44.731
back to the homes of those victims.

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.498
And, of course,

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:46.666
there's a long investigation

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:47.834
to go for the FBI

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.269
working with their Mexican authorities

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:50.270
to try to hold accountable

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.771
those responsible John.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.006
Josh Campbell, appreciate that.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.307
Let's continue the conversation

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.142
about law enforcement with John Miller.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:56.943
John, what are you learning

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:57.810
from your sources?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.379
And help our viewers understand,

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.080
this is sort of a wild, wild west

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.217
place in Mexico known to law enforcement

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:05.118
on that side of the border

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:07.253
and in the sometimes successful

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.088
sometimes not successful coordination

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.123
between American officials

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:11.958
and their Mexican counterparts.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:12.692
So, as you

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.193
say, John,

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:13.793
this is right

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:14.761
across the border

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.696
from Brownsville, Texas.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.364
It is a level four

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:21.134
no go State Department travel advisory.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.069
Do not travel,

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.171
the highest advisory that they give.

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:27.473
Yet there are many people

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:29.042
who cross over that border

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.810
for these medical appointments

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.478
or to go to these drug stores

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:33.346
where you can buy

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:34.581
over-the-counter things.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:36.783
That would be prescription here

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.718
buy drugs cheaper.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.587
A lot of people are getting counterfeit

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:43.790
drugs there that matched, you know,

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.692
names of painkillers that are

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:47.460
that are hard to come by here.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.162
So there's a lot of traffic,

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:52.599
tourist traffic, medical tourism there.

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:55.235
But what you see here is an instance

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.603
where you've got a crossover

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:57.737
because that territory

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:00.073
is largely controlled by the Gulf cartel.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:03.243
The Gulf cartel is one of the oldest,

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:05.144
longest running strongest,

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:06.479
heavily armed cartels.

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:08.581
And when you look at that vehicle,

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:10.650
you see that bullet hole

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.152
in the driver's side window.

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:16.589
You see a bullet hole directly below that

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.924
at the top of the door.

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:19.592
Further back

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:20.326
in the vehicle,

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:21.027
the passenger

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:23.029
side window is completely raked out.

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:24.497
And if that passenger

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:25.665
side door were closed,

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:26.332
you would see that

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:27.867
the tire of the rear tire

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:29.168
has been shot out.

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:30.970
There's another bullet hole above that.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.605
So we have a car

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.073
that was raked with gunfire,

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:34.941
which is kind of

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:35.742
our preview

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:36.476
to the idea

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:39.078
that two of our American victims

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.980
here, sadly, are deceased

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.814
because they opened

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:44.050
fire into that vehicle, drag them out

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:46.085
and then in talking to the victim,

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:48.721
who we believe may be

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:50.323
the one who survived,

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:52.492
based on the video we've seen of her

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.661
being put into the into the truck

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:56.462
to Washington McGee,

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.498
who was down there for her second visit

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:02.268
to complete a surgical procedure.

00:05:02.268 --> 00:05:04.771
It it appears that they would have been

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:06.806
talking to her and figuring out

00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:09.008
these are not what we suspected.

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:10.243
And that's been the working theory

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:10.777
that they thought

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:13.279
that they were taking some competing

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:16.015
Haitian smuggling gang out,

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:18.584
but that they'd run into Americans.

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:20.219
John, that, of course, creates a problem,

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:21.054
which is

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:21.654
we have now

00:05:21.654 --> 00:05:24.691
shot and wounded and or killed Americans

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:26.259
that have nothing to do

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.627
with the criminal world,

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:28.261
which makes them

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.296
a bit of a hot potato to that cartel.

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:32.365
So this is our blind spot right now.

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:33.900
Did the cartel

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.834
turn them over by

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:35.902
leaving them somewhere

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:37.904
to try and take the pressure

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:39.806
out of this problem between them,

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:41.040
the Mexican government and

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.075
the United States

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:45.178
or did the Mexican government

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:46.312
use intelligence,

00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:47.880
reconnaissance, surveillance,

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.949
locate them and rescue them?

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:50.550
And that's

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.918
that's what we're hoping to learn

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:52.919
from that press conference.

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:54.120
That's coming up.

00:05:54.754 --> 00:05:55.154
A key

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:56.422
detail still to come,

00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:57.890
but out with the State Department

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.225
follow up on that point from John Miller.

00:05:59.225 --> 00:05:59.859
The White House says

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:02.328
it wants answers from Mexican authorities

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:02.995
as soon as possible.

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:03.896
The attorney general says

00:06:03.896 --> 00:06:05.765
he will work with partners in Mexico

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:07.200
to try to get the answers here.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.468
As John Miller noted,

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:09.035
this is an area

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.069
the State Department long

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:11.704
has said to Americans, please,

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:12.872
it is not safe.

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:14.507
But what now?

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.175
Yeah, well, what U.S.

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:17.477
officials are looking to

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:19.011
learn is just more details

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:21.114
about what actually went down here.

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:22.949
We just heard from the White House,

00:06:22.949 --> 00:06:24.817
NSC is John Kirby,

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.285
who did appear to confirm

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:27.754
that some in this group are dead

00:06:27.754 --> 00:06:28.621
and some are alive.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:28.988
Obviously,

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:29.856
Mexican authorities

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:31.190
are the ones who said that

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.860
two of these four Americans have died

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.928
and two are alive at this point.

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:38.164
But what John Kirby said is that the U.S.

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:39.298
is extending

00:06:39.298 --> 00:06:40.900
its deepest condolences

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.368
to those who were killed.

00:06:42.368 --> 00:06:43.669
But he also referenced

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:46.038
those who survived this attack.

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:47.940
And the next steps here for the U.S.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.307
government,

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.876
specifically for State Department

00:06:49.876 --> 00:06:50.543
officials,

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.678
is notifying the families

00:06:52.678 --> 00:06:55.748
of those Americans as to what happened

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:57.483
and what their conditions are.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:58.284
Of course,

00:06:58.284 --> 00:07:00.420
continuing to monitor that situation.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.088
If those who are still alive

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:03.589
are in critical condition.

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:05.958
And so what we're waiting for

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:07.860
is that notification to happen.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.729
And then we'll probably learn more

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:12.031
from the State Department as to

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:13.166
what happened here.

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:14.634
What questions remain?

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:16.135
I think it's also important to note

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:17.770
that it's not just the State Department

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.571
that warned

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:20.206
Americans against traveling

00:07:20.206 --> 00:07:22.909
to this region of Mexico

00:07:22.909 --> 00:07:24.243
due to the criminal activity,

00:07:24.243 --> 00:07:26.746
due to the gang violence and the murders

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:27.713
that happen there,

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:29.182
but it's also the CDC

00:07:29.182 --> 00:07:30.116
that has warned

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:32.118
Americans against traveling there

00:07:32.118 --> 00:07:33.486
for medical tourism,

00:07:33.486 --> 00:07:34.487
saying that

00:07:34.487 --> 00:07:36.122
there could be many complications

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:38.257
that arise from those procedures.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:39.725
And we know that it is

00:07:39.725 --> 00:07:41.761
a medical cosmetic procedure

00:07:41.761 --> 00:07:43.830
that led this group of four

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.965
to actually travel to this region

00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:46.933
and travel alone.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:49.168
Let me try to button it up this way.

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:49.769
You mentioned

00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:50.937
this is one of the best

00:07:50.937 --> 00:07:51.871
known longest

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:54.207
running longest in power cartels.

00:07:54.707 --> 00:07:55.508
The State Department

00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:57.043
for a long time has told Americans

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:57.877
it is not safe,

00:07:57.877 --> 00:07:59.679
which gets to the point

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:01.347
that this cartel has been allowed

00:08:01.347 --> 00:08:02.014
to function

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:03.015
in this inner border,

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:04.817
that cross-government cooperation

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:05.518
is supposed to be

00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:07.620
to put these cartels out of business.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.121
Why this one so frustrating

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:11.257
and in this case, so deadly?

00:08:11.257 --> 00:08:13.893
Well, this is all about making money

00:08:13.893 --> 00:08:15.294
that that cartel generates,

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:16.262
not in the millions.

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:18.965
John, as you know, in the billions,

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:21.601
these are the main suppliers of fentanyl

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:23.870
which is killing Americans here

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.872
based on chemicals they get from China

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:27.740
and then money they launder

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.774
with Chinese organized

00:08:28.774 --> 00:08:30.643
